      "quote": "The term of this Agreement (the \"Term\") shall commence as of April 1, 2018 (the \"Effective Date\") and shall expire upon the later of: (a) the conclusion of the 2022/23 NFL season and (b) the last day in February, 2023 (such expiration date, the \"Scheduled Expiration Date\"), unless sooner terminated pursuant to the terms of this Agreement."
